{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29131","headline":"酬邢杜二员外 · 许浑","name":"酬邢杜二员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪带东风洗画屏，客星悬处聚文星。\n未归嵩岭暮云碧，久别杜陵春草青。\n熊轼并驱因雀噪，隼旟齐驻是鸿冥。\n岂知京洛旧亲友，梦绕潺湲江上亭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}